  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 1402.26 Infrastructure",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1402.26 “Infrastructure” means all structures and all mechanical and electrical equipment that connect a source of water to end users in a water system or that provide source water protection, including but not limited to all sources, treatment, storage, and distribution facilities and the land necessary therefor.\n\nSource. #13164, eff 1-26-21; renumbered by #13289 (formerly Env-Dw 1402.25); ss by #13372, eff 4-21-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw1400.html"
